<div class="alert alert-yellow" style="margin-top:2%;font-size:medium;">
    <p>AuthoMail uses LDAP authentication for CoreLogic users. In other words, approved CoreLogic users may use their windows username and password to log on. Since AuthoMail does not own your windows account, it doesn't provide a way to change password. You may use traditional ways to change your password such as 'Ctrl + Alt + Del' on your computer OR <a href="https://pwm.corelogic.com" target="_blank">https://pwm.corelogic.com.</a></p>
</div>
